    <string name="about_purpose">Why this app</string>
    <string name="about_purpose_text">MobileOffice was made to be free, safe and at no cost. Your documents are yours alone: the app has no internet permission, shows no ads, asks for no account and collects nothing. It opens, edits and converts Word, Excel, PowerPoint, PDF, UYAP and e-invoice files with care for Turkish, so that everyone can have a capable office tool without paying and without giving up their privacy.</string>
    <string name="home_title">Documents</string>
    <string name="open_short">Open</string>
    <string name="coffee_pitch">MobileOffice is made independently, with no ads, no selling of data and no paid version — and it should stay that way. The price of a coffee goes straight into new features, fixes and keeping the app free for everyone. If it made your work easier today, how about thanking it with a coffee? ☕</string>
    <string name="coffee_tr">Bana Bi Coffee — from Turkey, in lira</string>
    <string name="coffee_tr_hint">Card or bank transfer in Turkish lira</string>
